msgid "%s is there already"
msgstr "%s ya existe"

msgid "%s.m3u names other files"
msgstr "%s.m3u nombra otros archivos"

msgid "COMBINE"
msgstr "UNIR"

msgid "Combine discs button"
msgstr "Botón de unir discos"

msgid "Combined into %s"
msgstr "Unido en %s"

msgid "Couldn't combine %s"
msgstr "No se pudo unir %s"

msgid "Couldn't make %s"
msgstr "No se pudo crear %s"

msgid "Couldn't write %s"
msgstr "No se pudo escribir %s"

msgid "L2"
msgstr "L2"

msgid "MERGE"
msgstr "UNIR"

msgid "Move the discs of %.120s into a folder of their own?"
msgstr "¿Mover los discos de %.120s a una carpeta propia?"

msgid "Multi-disc"
msgstr "Multidisco"

msgid "R2"
msgstr "R2"

msgid "Shows the discs of a game, such as \"Game (Disc 1)\" and \"Game (Disc 2)\", as one game. Its first launch writes an .m3u listing them, and Y can move them into a folder of their own so you can change discs."
msgstr "Muestra los discos de un juego, como \"Game (Disc 1)\" y \"Game (Disc 2)\", como un solo juego. La primera vez que se abre escribe un .m3u con ellos, e Y puede moverlos a una carpeta propia para poder cambiar de disco."

msgid "Y"
msgstr "Y"
